&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Quantium?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quantium is a world leader in data science and artificial intelligence. Established in Australia in 2002, Quantium is a global team of more than 1,200 people across 14 locations with a unique blend of capabilities across product and consulting services to help businesses unlock value from data and analytics. Quantium partners with the world&#39;s largest corporations to forge a better, more intelligent world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We have an opportunity for an Accounts Receivable Officer to join our Finance Shared Services team, based at our Sydney (Eveleigh) office. Reporting to the Head of Finance Shared Services, you&#39;ll play an important role in keeping our accounts receivable ledger accurate and up to date, supporting healthy cash flow, and building strong relationships across Finance, Sales and our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ledger management: Process invoicing, collections and cash application across the accounts receivable ledger, keeping records accurate and up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debtor follow-up: Monitor aged debtors and proactively follow up on overdue accounts, escalating high-risk or disputed items as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconciliations: Support month-end reconciliations of accounts receivable sub-ledgers to the general ledger, helping to identify and resolve discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting: Help prepare debtor ageing reports and other accounts receivable metrics that support management reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query resolution: Work with customers and internal stakeholders to resolve billing queries and disputes in a professional and timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The superpowers you’ll be bringing to the team: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant experience: Experience in an accounts receivable, credit control, or broader finance role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with internal and external stakeholders that elevates the team and our service offering to our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems know-how: Working knowledge of ERP and accounting systems (e.g. SAP, Oracle, NetSuite) and confidence using Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail: High accuracy and strong numerical skills, even under time pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicator: Clear and professional communication skills, including confidence managing sensitive conversations with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised: Strong organisational and time management skills, with the ability to prioritise competing deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solver: A proactive approach to identifying and resolving discrepancies and disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remember – you might not tick all the boxes, but don’t let that from stopping you applying. We’re more interested in how you work, your ability to solve problems and think big.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What could your Quantium Experience look like?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Quantium will allow you to challenge your imagination. You will get to solve complex problems using rigor, precision and by asking great questions – but it also means you can think big, outside the box and push your problem-solving skills to the max.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining the Quantium team, you’ll get to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forge your path:&lt;/strong&gt; So many of our team have moved around different teams or offices. You’ll be in the driver’s seat, and we empower you to make your career your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find your kind:&lt;/strong&gt; Embrace diversity and connect with your tribe (think foodies, dog lovers, readers, or runners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Leave your mark. Your contributions resonate, regardless of your role or rank.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;But wait, there’s more!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On top of the Quantium Experience, you will enjoy a range of great benefits that go beyond the ordinary. Some of these include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work arrangements: Hybrid work, three days in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote working: Option to work in another country for up to 30 calendar days per year -- balancing your career with the freedom to work globally. Eligibility criteria apply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts and perks: Enjoy access to a range of generous discounts from Woolworths, exclusive banking products, health insurance and novated leasing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quantium are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity. We are a multicultural team of various beliefs, sexual orientations and gender identities. We celebrate our diversity of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status and disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quantium&#39;s recruitment process involves the collection and use of personal information. Please click on the link &quot;Privacy&quot; for Quantium&#39;s Collection Notice. This provides information on how we collect, use &amp;amp; store your personal information, including potential disclosure to our majority shareholder, Woolworths Group Limited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Apply now and let&#39;s forge a better, more intelligent world together!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Quantium’s recruitment process involves the collection and use of personal information, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://quantium.com/candidate-privacy-collection-notice/&quot;&gt;Candidate Data Collection Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information. T&lt;/span&gt;his provides information on how we collect, use &amp;amp; store your personal information, including potential disclosure to our majority shareholder, Woolworths Group Limited.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

