&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing strategic expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You have some experience in data-driven insight generation and are honing your skills in business problem-solving strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FMCG/Retail experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience working in a FMCG business, with growing ability to contribute analytical solutions in a commercial context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
