&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Orchestrate seamless visitor experiences through professional reception services, security protocols, and meeting room coordination for high-profile client engagements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
