&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible work arrangements: &lt;/strong&gt;This is a full-time, 5-day on-site role given the nature of front-of-house coverage — within that, benefit from flexible start and finish times to support your work-life balance.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
